    "notes": "ROM-GTCV selected — hunger is a dynamic temporary process, not a static position. It builds to a peak (starving) then subsides through eating to satisfaction. Full bell curve: ascending = growing hunger, peak = most hungry, descending = eating/satisfaction. Distinct from CC-0001 Appetite (archilexeme/static spectrum) — this card focuses on the hunger process specifically."
